Hi there.

This update focuses on fixing bugs in Construction Mode of the game and does not offer any new content this time. Here's the list of what's done:

- Fixed aqueduct and road tiles overlay in construction mode;
- Fixed roadblocks display in construction mode;
- Fixed a crash after calling entertainment advisor;
- Fixed changes processing in the city properties window;
- Fixed open layer display in construction mode;
- Fixed tiles rendering order in construction mode;
- Fixed language selection dialog if no language files are present;
- Fixed buildings construction on tiles if they already have other objects;
- Fields/Meadows tiles now can get on file as well if a farm is on fire;

+ Added a layer to display market availability for houses;
+ Added extended sound settings for game objects.

The next update will come with more fixes and new content as well. It will be out pretty soon.

Thanks for waiting and thank you for all of your support. :)

