Well hello there.

[img]http://i.imgur.com/3VhoYDI.png[/img]

Summer heat is killing us, but do not worry - Caesaria lives. Here's an important update. It may still hold '65' build number, but don't be mistaken by it - there's a plenty of deep fixes. No new content this time, we had to concentrate on fixing bugs this time.

Here's what we've got:

+ Added a layer to display the mood in the city;
+ Added religion state descriptions to the main adviser window;
+ Added dock info-window which displays the current status of the warehouse;
+ Added an option to set automatic demolition of the houses near an infected building;
+ Healthcare buildings now keep records on the number of patients, relevant statistics is displayed in the adviser on healthcare window;
+ Improved Romanian translation;

- Fixed city treasury balance calculation routine;
- Fixed trade routes data loading, traders will not disappear near cities anymore;
- Fixed the drawing order of columns on the information layers, they will no longer cover buildings and people;
- Fixed parameters reading from the last year of a city's history;
- Fixed tiles display in the water resources layer;
- Fixed that bug with tax when calculating mood in the house;
- Fixed recruiters behavior, they no longer get stuck near buildings if there are no people available for hire in the district;
- Fixed calculation of the current state of healthcare in the city;
- Fixed Roman calendar to correctly display names of the months;
- Senate info-window no longer comes off screen;
- Corrected adviser on healthcare tips;

* Re-worked trader's info-window, now it shows what was bought/sold by a trader;
* Buildings removal mode is now disabled by Esc.


Stay tuned for more summer updates. New content is comming soon. :)
And, as always, thank you for your support.

