Welcome to the spring!

And welcome new CaesarIA version for Android! And new bug fixes! And new content! Yeah, we're overexcited! Exclamation points! 

Let's start with Android. Sorry, no Google Play yet, so to try this version you need to:

1. Install the game - download game's .apk-file, install it as usual;
2. Copy game's cache to "/sdcard/Android/data/net.dalerank.caesaria/files".

apk: http://sourceforge.net/projects/opencaesar3/files/bin/caesaria-0.5-android-build-20150305.apk/download
cache:  http://sourceforge.net/projects/opencaesar3/files/bin/caesaria-0.5-cache-20150305.zip/download

And now to a bunch of bugfixes and several new additions to the game:

- Fixed town citizens overlays glitch;
- Fixed a bug when original C3 saves were loaded with an incorrect climate zone;
- Fixed senate shadows overlays;
- Fixed MacOS startup script - now it will check before installing needed frameworks in order to make sure they are not already installed;
- Fixed a bug preventing unfinished Emperor's requests notifications from appearing;
- Fixed incorrect governor's data saving routine;
- Fixed disabled scrolling in buildings info window;
- Fixed incorrect recruiter behavior when recruiting for a fountain;
- Fixed tax calculations for a single house;
- Fixed several issues with financial statistics in financial adviser window;
- Fixed bad city regions health notifications algorithm;
- Fixed game crash in a free game mode after an incorrectly dated event is called;
- Fixed game crash after you add new service personnel with incorrect paths;
- Fixed several minor bugs in tutorial missions; 

+ Added Android build;
+ Added bad health level animation for houses;
+ Added tradeswoman textures;
+ Added crashlogs saving for Windows and MacOS;
+ Added "load last game" button to the main menu;
+ Added general city health layer;
+ Added current mission title to the current goals window;
+ Added custom C3 audio/video resources path support;
+ Added unwanted buildings around houses equation - now they affect house levels;
+ Scribes messages window reworked.

We won't get tired thanking all of you for support and help. Thank you again, everyone who contributed or helped in any other way.

- Team CaesarIA

