Hi there. Today we have several fixes and new content.

But first of all... FIRES! Yep, an important note about that. The thing with fires is that they appear not only because of the absense of a prefecture, but also they can start in sick areas of your town. This happens when you don't have enough doctors around. But at the moment, the icon which must be shown above sick households is not there yet (not finished) and this is why you don't see it comming. We will fix this as soon as possible, but for now - more doctors will help you.

Now for the main part:

- Fixed steam-api work for Windows version;
- Fixed first tutorial mission tasks (shout out to Softer S);
- Fixed an issue with double resolution listing in Display Settings;
- Fixed several minor and rare glitches;

+ Added fire animation variety for different types of ruins;
+ Added detailed texture for town's entry/exit points;
+ Added commercial buildings to "Open Play" mode;
+ Added your first achivement (for test purposes) - all you need to do to get "First Win" is to successfully finish the first mission;
+ Added achivements reel to the main menu screen of the game;
+ Added missing parts to all localizations;
+ Added an option to the setting which allows to disable/enable zoom and its inversion;
+ Added an option to enable/disable "Debug" menu during the gameplay.

Thank you for all your suggestions and bug reports. Keep them comming.

